==Description== <!--T:2-->

<!--T:3-->
This macro generates a parametric box with interlocking finger joints (notches) for laser cutting or 3D printing. It creates the individual faces of the box as separate objects, each with notches that interlock to form a rigid structure without requiring glue, screws, or additional fasteners.

The macro is particularly useful for:
* **Laser cutting**: Generates flat 2D profiles ready for laser cutting machines (DXF export compatible)
* **3D printing**: Creates box parts that can be printed flat and assembled
* **Rapid prototyping**: Quickly iterate on box dimensions without manual modeling

